<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National Processing.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National Processing.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Jim Kissane said he initiated coverage of National Processing Inc with a buy rating and 12-month price target of $24.</p>
<p>-- &quot;National Processing is a high quality computer services company that is well-positioned in the two fastest growing sectors of the the computer services industry -- electronic payment processing and corporate outsourcing,&quot; Kissane said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/4 at 19-3/4.</p>
</text>
